      "filename": "Steinway grand piano constructions including Tubular Metallic Action Frame, MIM PHX.jpg",
      "title": "File:Steinway grand piano constructions including Tubular Metallic Action Frame, MIM PHX.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/Steinway_grand_piano_constructions_including_Tubular_Metallic_Action_Frame%2C_MIM_PHX.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
