      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Steinway_grand_piano_constructions_including_Tubular_Metallic_Action_Frame,_MIM_PHX_(digitally_altered_photo,_270_degree_rotated).jpg",
      "width": 3457,
